WEBVTT

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:09.050
Shonan Kyokutou High School

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:09.620
What the hell?!

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:14.400
Freshmen Class E, Onizuka
Eikichi and Danma Ryujii

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:19.700
Are expelled as punishment for
their repeated acts of violence?!

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.920
Eh! Not quite.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:23.320
Eikichi-san!

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:24.520
Ryuuji-san...

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:28.400
That was always our plan.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.700
We've gotten off light by being expelled.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.100
Wait... please take us with you!

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:42.400
We'll have to take on Kyokutou
alone and we can't do that!

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:43.520
You guys...

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:47.520
Stay away from Demon Eikichi and Bomb Ryuuji.

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:49.220
For you own good...

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.920
But we can't...

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:52.020
Hey!

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:54.320
I know you can do it.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:56.420
Well, good luck.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:00.320
Oh, those two are awesome!

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:03.220
What are you going to do now?

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.720
That's right...

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:06.820
I think we'll get demon haircuts...

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.420
And start a gang.

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:13.020
The Onibaku duo's heading full speed!

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:19.000
SHONAN JUNAI GUMI!

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:17.280
Down the delinquent highway!

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.780
That went awesome!

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:26.580
Those guys totally believed we were expelled.

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:28.780
Sign: Hairdresser

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:30.080
They had no clue that we
made that poster ourselves.

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:33.830
Are there really still people
who want to start gangs?

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:35.730
I don't want to hang around those guys.

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:39.430
Sixteen magazine

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:39.730
Yeah, totally! Delinquents these
days are worse than otaku.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:46.230
We should celebrate cutting ties with those
morons and going to co-ed heaven.

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:49.630
We've graduated from being delinquents!

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:54.430
Here comes the love duo!

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:56.030
Thank you very much!

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:58.630
Ryuuji, do you think it'll work?

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:00.830
Yeah, it's a sure thing, Eikichi!

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:03.930
Our love duo plan has begun...

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:07.770
With a part time job at a resort!

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:16.920
Yoronto

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:43.690
Women, women, women! Women!

00:02:44.690 --> 00:02:46.690
Their long legs...

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:48.890
R-Right in front of our eyes...

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:51.390
If I just had one of those babes...

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:55.280
Just let me at one of them...

00:02:57.430 --> 00:02:59.200
A-Awesome...!

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:00.700
Thongs!

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:05.500
Turned on

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:05.000
I'm so glad we came...!

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:04.920
Yeah...

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:05.920
Stop!

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:06.520
Eh?

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:09.580
What are you doing?

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:11.180
Come on!

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:13.780
Let's beach volley together.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:15.180
Let go!

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:16.680
Go away, you delinquents!

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.380
Oh, how cold...

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:20.680
Some ladies are being picked on...

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:22.180
Huh?

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:23.680
Stop it!

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:25.080
I said let go!

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:28.320
Cuuuuuute!!

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:31.920
What's the problem? You ain't
got nothing better to do, right?

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:32.870
Umm...

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:33.470
Huh?

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:37.670
It's going to be a problem if you
keep acting like that, sir.

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:39.270
Those guys!

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:43.170
What's this? You tryin' to pick a fight?

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:44.740
Calm down, calm down...!

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:47.240
If it's all right, why don't we have
a nice chat over there?

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:48.640
Yes, yes, this way please!

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:51.200
Interesting...

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:53.660
Umm...!

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:55.660
Please don't fight...

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:57.560
Yes, yes, come this way...!

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:02.090
I-I wonder if they'll be all right...

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:13.470
Well, they understood us after we had
a heart-to-heart with each other.

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:15.340
That's great!

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:19.040
Thanks, guys! They wouldn't stop bugging us.

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:22.440
Oh, no! It's what any man would do!

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:26.390
Protecting the visitor's safety
is our job, after all.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:27.930
That's wonderful!

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:28.930
So sweet!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:30.690
Oh, well...

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.790
<i>It's a complete success!</i>

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:35.310
<i>Well worth a little knuckle pain!</i>

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:36.610
Delinquents are disgusting!

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:37.210
Huh?

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:39.310
They're garbage!

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:40.410
Maggots!

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:41.310
Roaches!

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:44.510
No, they're even lower than roaches!

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:49.010
It'd be better if guys like that were wiped
from the face of the earth!

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:50.110
Right, boys?

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:53.210
Y-Yeah, I guess so...!

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:57.720
We hate those darn delinquents!

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:00.720
<i>I'm so glad we quit being delinquents...</i>

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:03.720
<i>If we were delinquents, we'd
be lower than roaches.</i>

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:04.720
<i>And...</i>

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:07.520
<i>girls would hate us!</i>

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:20.950
We just started working here today.

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:25.050
Oh, really? It's lucky you
were there for us earlier.

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:27.250
Oh, it was nothing...

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:29.050
This must be fate.

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:30.750
Y-Yeah, I guess so!

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:33.250
I'm Mariko, and this is Ayumi.

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.750
We're juniors at Dainippon Girls College.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:37.250
Eh?

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:38.050
Nice to meet you!

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.950
N-Nice to meet you, too!

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:46.450
Hey... Dainippon Girls College is know for
having nothing but awesome women.

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:53.850
Oh... yeah, I'm Onizuka Eikichi.

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:55.610
I'm Danma Ryuuji.

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:58.310
We're medical students at Okei University.

00:05:58.410 --> 00:05:58.710
Eh?

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:02.210
Eh? Med students at Okei?! That's great!

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:04.520
Oh, no... it's not such a big deal.

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:05.320
Hey!

00:06:05.620 --> 00:06:08.120
It's fine, it's a resort after all.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:08.920
Eh?

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:11.420
These two are pretty hot, aren't they?

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:12.320
Mariko...

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:14.520
Hey, hey! Why don't we go to the disco?

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:17.020
Yeah, that sounds great!
Let's go, Ayumi!

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:18.120
But...!

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:19.420
It's okay, it's okay...

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.910
Let's go! Let's have some fun!

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:22.810
Yeah!

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:25.170
Ryuuji, let's go!

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:26.070
Uh, sure...

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:28.970
Ayumi...

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:47.430
Mariko, is it all right to lie like that?

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:49.830
It's all right to lie about your age a little.

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.130
But you said we were colleges students!

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:53.430
Oh, it's fine...!

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:58.530
At resorts like this, you have to
play the resort hook up game.

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:01.030
I'm not that type of woman.

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:05.630
You can do it without me. I don't need a guy.

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.660
You'd be happier if you loosened up.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:08.660
Huh?

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:12.540
Loosen up, and forget all about
what happened in the past.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:14.240
Mariko...

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:18.750
What are you looking at?

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:20.150
Uh! Nothing...

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:23.710
You're all right with Ayumi then, right?

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:24.210
Uh?

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:28.350
I can tell. You've been staring at
her for a while now, haven't you?

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:31.200
Ryuuji, this is our chance!

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:34.490
Let's secure our victory and
take them to the hotel!

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:35.690
Y-Yeah!

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:46.250
Move! Move!

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:53.110
Those bastards!

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:58.460
Eikichi-kun, your dancing is incredible!

00:07:58.560 --> 00:07:59.160
Really?

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:00.160
Right, Ayumi?

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:01.560
Er, yeah...

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.700
W-Well...

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:08.820
Aren't these guys lots of fun?

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:10.920
I don't know about that...!

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:12.120
Hey, losers!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.320
You really did it this afternoon!

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:16.820
Huh?

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:18.750
Who are you again?

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:20.200
Don't play dumb!

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:21.350
Damned little brat!

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:23.050
Damned little brat?!

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:24.650
Wait, Eikichi...

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.600
We gave up being delinquents.

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:29.600
These girls will realize we're even
rougher than those guys!

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:33.070
That's right. Our big chance...

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:37.070
Come on, come on... how about
we discuss this outside?

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:38.070
Shut up!!

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:43.530
Eikichi-kun!

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:44.430
Ryuuji-kun!

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.130
Hey, what's wrong?

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:48.230
Aah! Stop!

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:54.890
- Let go! Let me go!
- Come on, you like it!

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:56.760
Hey, wait!

00:08:57.460 --> 00:08:59.360
I was holding back because I was with women...

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:03.240
but you've really pissed me off.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:05.440
You pushed me over the limit!

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:09.140
Do you guys understand who
you're picking a fight with?

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:11.940
Shonan Kyokutou High School freshmen...

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:14.090
Onizuka Eikichi and...

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:16.190
Danma Ryuuji!

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:19.890
Feared by women and children and
admired by men, the Onibaku duo!

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:20.890
Huh?

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:26.860
Shonan Kyokutou High School freshmen...

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:28.160
That means...

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:30.260
they're high school students?

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:35.240
And infamous delinquents too!

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:42.060
So, the Okei med student story...

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:43.360
Was a total lie, huh?

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:50.160
W-We should run!

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:51.660
Y-Yep!

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:12.860
What's with you, Ryuuji?

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:16.060
Are you still blue?

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:17.360
Well...

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:21.560
I might only get a chance at a
woman like that once in my life.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:25.370
Don't be so picky. It's our first
day as transfer students.

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:29.630
Our youth is just beginning... look!

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:33.980
Check it out, there are plenty of cute
girls in school uniforms, ain't there?

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:38.020
Oh! I can't wait...!

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:42.830
Flirting after school with those lonely girls...

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.830
that look so good in those little uniforms!

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:46.430
Y-Yeah!

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:48.480
This is co-ed, baby!

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:49.830
That's true!

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:51.520
Our youth...

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:53.490
Yes, our youth...

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.760
begins right here!

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:13.340
Aah, so it's the new semester already.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:15.190
I'm still in vacation mode somehow.

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:16.190
Me too...

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:17.670
Ah! Murakoshi-sensei.

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:18.740
Yes?

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:21.000
Oh! Mr. Principal!

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:22.510
Good morning!

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:23.610
Good morning.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:28.660
I wanted to let you know that there are
transfer students entering your class today.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:29.740
Okay.

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:31.470
Ah, you two...

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:34.950
Pleased to meet y-... ah?!

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:40.510
Ask Murakoshi-sensei for the
details on you new school, all right?

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:43.710
And try to be diligent in your
studies. Well then, I'm off.

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:53.750
Ack! Why are you guys here?!

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:54.900
No, why are YOU here?!

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.700
You dress like that even though
you're delinquents!!

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:58.670
Why are you teaching here?!

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:12.450
Well, why are med students
transferring to out school?

00:12:12.550 --> 00:12:14.710
That's my line...

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:17.580
What happened to the story about you
being college students, huh?

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:20.680
What happened to your regent
hairstyle, you pervert?

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:24.570
Eh! You're the kind of sick woman
that lies about her age!

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:26.190
<i>You women...</i>

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:29.860
<i>you were intending to fake your way
through the summer from the start, huh?</i>

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:34.890
<i>What's with this guy? He thought he
could just get away with his lies!</i>

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:38.390
<i>You really piss me off!</i>

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:41.690
<i>Oh... you guys me me sick!</i>

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:46.970
Stand!

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:48.810
Bow!

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:50.460
Good morning!

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:51.420
Take your seats!

00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:53.420
All right, everyone...

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:57.810
there's a couple of transfer students joining us.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:04.750
<i>Why do I, of all people, have to
be their homeroom teacher?</i>

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:06.900
Well then, let's introduce them...

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:07.700
Uh...

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:09.700
Greetings everyone!

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:11.390
I'm Onizuka Eikichi!

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:12.830
I'm Danma Ryuuji!

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:14.610
Let's hit it off right.

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:15.410
Yeah!

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:20.080
Well, my hobbies are reading and music.

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:22.050
I wonder if that's too normal.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:26.680
My hobby is sports! I especially
take pride in tennis and skiing.

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:29.080
But studying, not so much...

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:38.730
But as new transfer students, we want
to pass in the areas of love and youth!

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:42.600
<i>As if they weren't bottom of
the barrel delinquents...</i>

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:46.820
<i>How dare they act so charming?</i>

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:50.270
Hey, hey, those guys seem pretty sweet!

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:51.920
And funny somehow!

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:53.490
<i>We've got it, we've got it!</i>

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:56.260
<i>Good response right from the beginning!</i>

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:57.550
<i>We've got it!</i>

00:13:57.720 --> 00:13:59.390
Pleased to meet you, everyone!

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:00.490
Unbelievable!

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:02.450
A-Are you okay?

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:05.600
I can't believe how charming they're acting.

00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:07.100
What should we do?

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:12.750
If we leave them alone, they'll
devour every girl in the school!

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:15.050
Snot-nosed brats!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:16.650
I won't forgive them...

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:17.150
Eh?

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:21.310
I'll never forgive them for this!

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:22.060
Um...

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:23.060
Ayumi!

00:14:23.260 --> 00:14:25.460
Eh? Eh? Oh!

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:29.480
Eh? Why did you transfer here?

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:33.140
Hmm, nothing but morons there.

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:36.730
It felt like a zoo.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:37.730
No way!

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:38.830
Really?

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:42.370
This is like a heavenly garden by comparison.

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:43.920
Oh, you're just being sweet.

00:14:44.050 --> 00:14:45.210
It's true, it's true!

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:47.970
Hey, hey, are you dating someone right now?

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:48.780
Are you?

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:50.390
<i>Here we go...!</i>

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:52.070
Nope!

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:53.810
No way!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.170
You must be!

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:57.970
We've only gone to all guy schools so far.

00:14:58.070 --> 00:15:01.880
We don't know what would've happened
if there were girls in our class.

