00:30:19.170 --> 00:30:19.670
Eh?

00:30:19.970 --> 00:30:22.300
Um... Onizuka Eikichi-kun?

00:30:23.200 --> 00:30:23.600
Yeah!

00:30:27.800 --> 00:30:29.150
I'm Aina.

00:30:29.550 --> 00:30:31.480
Yarita Aina, nice to meet you!

00:30:31.880 --> 00:30:34.920
I'm her friend, Shirayuki Momoko.
Pleased to meet you!

00:30:36.420 --> 00:30:39.080
I'm so glad I'm alive!

00:30:40.180 --> 00:30:40.980
Umm...

00:30:41.180 --> 00:30:42.480
What happened?

00:30:44.120 --> 00:30:45.200
They got hard.

00:30:47.500 --> 00:30:51.350
<i>And then my friend said ...</i>

00:30:48.080 --> 00:30:50.380
<i>That damn Eikichi...</i>

00:30:51.430 --> 00:30:55.030
<i>I wonder if he's really intending to do it tonight.</i>

00:30:51.460 --> 00:30:55.140
<i>She rode on a beautiful foreign car...</i>

00:30:55.400 --> 00:30:57.360
<i>I can't go it alone here!</i>

00:30:59.580 --> 00:31:00.580
That's funny!

00:31:00.680 --> 00:31:01.720
Isn't it?

00:31:03.620 --> 00:31:05.710
You're so interesting, Eikichi-kun!

00:31:05.810 --> 00:31:07.620
I-I guess...!

00:31:07.720 --> 00:31:09.380
I haven't laughed this much in a long time.

00:31:09.480 --> 00:31:12.170
<i>All right, all right! I've got a hold on her!</i>

00:31:12.270 --> 00:31:16.280
<i>Yes, yes, I know but it must be true...</i>

00:31:13.530 --> 00:31:15.400
<i>Then... then I'm going to...</i>

00:31:15.500 --> 00:31:20.480
<i>going to be with Momoko-chan!</i>

00:31:16.780 --> 00:31:20.550
<i>I am often told that I am pretty...</i>

00:31:21.220 --> 00:31:22.360
Aaah!

00:31:23.410 --> 00:31:24.360
Wh-Wh-What's wrong?

00:31:24.460 --> 00:31:25.830
Where's Aina and Eikichi-kun?

00:31:26.070 --> 00:31:29.810
T-They just went for a walk somewhere, but...

00:31:30.180 --> 00:31:31.530
This is bad...

00:31:32.170 --> 00:31:32.910
W-Why?

00:31:33.310 --> 00:31:35.630
Aina has a little secret...

00:31:36.600 --> 00:31:37.200
Secret?

00:31:37.580 --> 00:31:42.220
I've always been a shy girl and haven't
really had the chance to talk to guys.

00:31:42.320 --> 00:31:42.990
Oh, come on...!

00:31:43.090 --> 00:31:44.600
Really it's true!

00:31:45.230 --> 00:31:46.070
The truth is...

00:31:46.570 --> 00:31:49.780
I've never even dated a guy.

00:31:49.880 --> 00:31:51.390
Come on, come on!

00:31:51.490 --> 00:31:52.990
I'm telling you, it's true!

00:31:53.690 --> 00:31:55.980
So, I want to finally feel...

00:31:57.270 --> 00:31:59.710
...what real love is like.

00:32:00.150 --> 00:32:00.460
Eh?

00:32:01.720 --> 00:32:04.550
I've always, always been looking for him.

00:32:05.890 --> 00:32:07.110
My soul mate.

00:32:09.910 --> 00:32:11.230
A man like you... Eikichi-kun.

00:32:16.620 --> 00:32:18.190
A-Aina-chan...

00:32:19.210 --> 00:32:21.590
<i>This is the virgin sacrifice
they were talking about...</i>

00:32:21.990 --> 00:32:22.770
Please...

00:32:24.500 --> 00:32:25.270
Kiss me.

00:32:26.020 --> 00:32:27.510
<i>It wasn't a lie!</i>

00:32:29.410 --> 00:32:30.410
WHAT?!

00:32:30.650 --> 00:32:34.220
A-Aina-chan has a venereal disease?

00:32:35.540 --> 00:32:38.040
The truth is that girl plays around a lot.

00:32:38.270 --> 00:32:42.550
I don't know if you'd say she's
easy or just really fickle.

00:32:42.990 --> 00:32:47.030
Anyway, she ends up having
sex with guys really fast.

00:32:47.360 --> 00:32:49.380
<i>With that pure face...</i>

00:32:49.480 --> 00:32:54.500
And one of the guys she had sex with...

00:32:54.700 --> 00:32:56.780
is this violent creep who keeps following her around.

00:32:57.290 --> 00:33:00.200
So, I've been watching over her.

00:33:01.160 --> 00:33:04.380
It's only going to get worse if she
doesn't get her act together.

00:33:04.480 --> 00:33:10.510
<i>Shit... I bet that damn Eikichi is getting
some action right about now...</i>

00:33:11.020 --> 00:33:11.910
Ryuuji-kun?

00:33:12.110 --> 00:33:13.350
Aina-chan...

00:33:13.850 --> 00:33:15.070
I love you.

00:33:15.790 --> 00:33:18.300
<i>Here I go... my first kiss.</i>

00:33:19.870 --> 00:33:22.900
<i>You're so slow. Hurry up and kiss me!</i>

00:33:23.490 --> 00:33:24.310
I love you...

00:33:24.900 --> 00:33:28.250
Aina-chan... <i>I love you too.</i>

00:33:30.680 --> 00:33:32.360
Yo, Aina, you slut!

00:33:33.870 --> 00:33:36.590
How cold of you to do this...

00:33:37.090 --> 00:33:39.400
when you already have a guy like me.

00:33:39.750 --> 00:33:41.280
Ma-Machida-san!

00:33:41.320 --> 00:33:43.380
Playing around as always?

00:33:43.580 --> 00:33:44.610
You like it, don't you?

00:33:44.710 --> 00:33:46.700
Who are these guys?

00:33:46.800 --> 00:33:49.970
They're some rough guys that have been
following me around for a while.

00:33:50.640 --> 00:33:56.610
Tell me, who was the one who screamed
with pleasure in my arms?

00:33:58.070 --> 00:33:59.740
That's a lie!

00:34:00.330 --> 00:34:03.600
Boy, that woman... she's got a disease.

00:34:03.900 --> 00:34:06.360
A man-loving disease.

00:34:06.630 --> 00:34:10.410
I bet she's been with hundreds of guys.

00:34:11.970 --> 00:34:12.930
R-Really?

00:34:13.030 --> 00:34:15.620
E-Eikichi-kun, I lied to you.

00:34:15.940 --> 00:34:20.810
Aina-chan, I don't care, you'll be mine anyway!

00:34:21.820 --> 00:34:24.440
Don't bother my Aina-chan!

00:34:25.830 --> 00:34:28.170
"My Aina-chan", he says!

00:34:29.440 --> 00:34:31.020
What's so funny?!

00:34:31.420 --> 00:34:33.840
<i>Just when I was coming
across as a normal guy!</i>

00:34:34.350 --> 00:34:38.290
You think a kid like you can
stand up to men like us?

00:34:38.660 --> 00:34:41.630
Good, then show us what you've got!

00:34:42.140 --> 00:34:47.680
Aina-chan, it's time for me to
show you my true identity.

00:34:47.980 --> 00:34:48.280
Huh?

00:34:49.170 --> 00:34:51.590
DELINQUENT FLASH!

00:34:52.280 --> 00:34:53.250
Wh-What?

00:34:53.500 --> 00:34:55.940
Ta-da! Well?

00:34:57.750 --> 00:34:58.460
Eh?

00:35:00.560 --> 00:35:04.630
Aina-chan, the truth is, I'm a
delinquent soldier of love.

00:35:06.900 --> 00:35:11.150
So, what should I do to your asses...

00:35:11.350 --> 00:35:12.910
for totally ruining my date?

00:35:13.010 --> 00:35:14.060
Don't make me laugh!

00:35:14.270 --> 00:35:15.840
We won't be easy on you!

00:35:16.630 --> 00:35:19.900
All I need against you is one arm.

00:35:21.280 --> 00:35:22.440
You'd better shut up!

00:35:25.560 --> 00:35:26.930
Don't make light of Shonan's...

00:35:28.690 --> 00:35:29.370
Bastard!

00:35:29.630 --> 00:35:31.730
Onizuka Eikichi!

00:35:32.720 --> 00:35:35.320
Or you'll regret it!

00:35:42.430 --> 00:35:45.590
Oh! This might be a real fight.

00:35:47.620 --> 00:35:48.860
Of course it will!

00:35:49.140 --> 00:35:51.560
I'll kill you, boy...

00:35:51.960 --> 00:35:54.560
Stop talking big... come and get it!

00:36:01.230 --> 00:36:04.430
I told you I would kill you.

00:36:13.330 --> 00:36:15.580
<i>What kind of punches are these?</i>

00:36:15.680 --> 00:36:18.900
Hey, hey! Who told you we were done?

00:36:31.630 --> 00:36:35.460
It feels so good to punch like
this now and then, y'know?

00:36:37.640 --> 00:36:38.590
Hey!

00:36:40.190 --> 00:36:41.290
Stop it!

00:36:42.090 --> 00:36:44.830
Aina-chan, let's go have some fun together.

00:36:45.430 --> 00:36:47.130
No! Let me go!

00:36:47.380 --> 00:36:50.860
What's the problem? We'll all make
you feel real good inside.

00:36:51.240 --> 00:36:52.530
No!!

00:36:52.630 --> 00:36:53.350
Wait...!

00:36:54.820 --> 00:36:59.080
I'm not finished yet...!

00:37:00.760 --> 00:37:01.860
You little brat!

00:37:04.560 --> 00:37:07.960
Wait! You'll kill him!

00:37:08.060 --> 00:37:10.970
Hey guys, hold him down!

00:37:11.070 --> 00:37:12.580
Are you serious?

00:37:12.680 --> 00:37:13.690
That's too much...

00:37:13.790 --> 00:37:14.840
Do it!!

00:37:14.940 --> 00:37:18.680
Bastard... now you have to use your buddies?

00:37:19.080 --> 00:37:21.470
Can't you win in a one-on-one fight?

00:37:23.660 --> 00:37:29.190
In a fight, you win when your
opponent falls. There are no rules!

00:37:29.390 --> 00:37:30.640
Ma-Machida-san...

00:37:31.080 --> 00:37:33.890
Isn't that right?!

00:37:52.810 --> 00:37:54.020
I heard there was a fight...

00:37:54.120 --> 00:37:55.460
There's blood everywhere!

00:37:55.560 --> 00:37:56.720
Will he survive?

00:37:57.050 --> 00:37:57.580
Eikichi?

00:37:58.530 --> 00:37:59.230
Eikichi!

00:38:01.600 --> 00:38:02.470
What happened, Eikichi?

00:38:02.570 --> 00:38:03.650
Hey, you can't be here!

00:38:03.770 --> 00:38:04.370
Shut up!!

00:38:04.710 --> 00:38:05.390
Eikichi!

00:38:06.240 --> 00:38:08.270
EIKICHI!!!

00:38:23.620 --> 00:38:26.190
<i>What? You lost, Eikichi-san?</i>

00:38:26.910 --> 00:38:30.920
<i>It's not like I really lost.
Those bastards didn't fight fair.</i>

00:38:31.260 --> 00:38:33.390
<i>They got me in a ten-on-one brawl.</i>

00:38:33.750 --> 00:38:35.710
<i>Well, my arm's broken.</i>

00:38:36.110 --> 00:38:40.160
<i>But hey, that's the price you gotta
pay to take out five guys.</i>

00:38:40.380 --> 00:38:41.850
<i>So, you're definitely going, right?</i>

00:38:42.140 --> 00:38:42.380
<i>Huh?</i>

00:38:44.470 --> 00:38:46.340
<i>To get revenge... revenge!</i>

00:38:46.550 --> 00:38:49.020
<i>You're going to avenge yourself and finish it, right?</i>

00:38:54.190 --> 00:38:56.420
<i>I'll lend a hand when you do.</i>

00:38:56.720 --> 00:38:57.830
<i>Yeah, let's do it!</i>

00:38:58.820 --> 00:39:01.530
<i>Y-Yeah... when my arm heals.</i>

00:39:02.210 --> 00:39:03.310
<i>That's not like you...</i>

00:39:03.720 --> 00:39:07.960
<i>You'd normally never be
so scared about a fight.</i>

00:39:08.060 --> 00:39:10.380
<i>Who's scared?</i>

00:39:10.890 --> 00:39:14.960
<i>I told you I'm gonna go when my arm heals, didn't I?</i>

00:39:16.270 --> 00:39:18.210
<i>Stop getting so worked up over nothing!</i>

00:39:18.720 --> 00:39:19.790
Dammit!

00:39:30.570 --> 00:39:32.890
Listen to me...

00:39:34.190 --> 00:39:38.200
Aina said she feels awful about
what she did to Eikichi-kun.

00:39:38.300 --> 00:39:41.420
But don't blame her so much.
She's not bad at all.

00:39:42.340 --> 00:39:44.530
And she got taken against her will...

00:39:45.040 --> 00:39:47.400
by that guy again today.

00:39:47.500 --> 00:39:49.860
I didn't come to talk about her.

00:39:51.090 --> 00:39:53.040
I'm here about the guy that messed up Eikichi.

00:39:55.000 --> 00:39:57.710
You'd better off forgetting about it.

00:39:57.810 --> 00:39:59.590
WHO THE HELL IS HE?!

00:40:03.600 --> 00:40:04.110
Camaro.

00:40:06.720 --> 00:40:10.850
He drives a red Z-28 Camaro.

00:40:14.050 --> 00:40:17.010
Don't try running off on me again, you hear?

00:40:19.500 --> 00:40:21.870
I ain't gonna let you off so easy next time.

00:40:22.230 --> 00:40:25.580
Besides, you're my woman.

00:40:25.680 --> 00:40:28.090
You'll be by my side all the way to the gates of hell.

00:40:28.560 --> 00:40:30.520
Right, Aina-chan?

00:40:34.040 --> 00:40:35.010
Dammit!

00:40:36.390 --> 00:40:39.200
Isn't there anything that'll make me feel better?

00:40:39.300 --> 00:40:41.180
Seems like you're in a bad mood.

00:40:43.600 --> 00:40:44.620
Oh, it's you...

00:40:45.120 --> 00:40:47.060
His name is Machida...

00:40:47.660 --> 00:40:48.700
the guy who did this to you.

00:40:49.130 --> 00:40:51.780
Seems he made a bit of a name for himself,

00:40:51.880 --> 00:40:55.340
as a high school boxing champ.

00:40:56.780 --> 00:41:01.130
They said he used brass knuckles in his fights.

00:41:01.630 --> 00:41:04.840
Sounds like he has no problem
using dirty tricks to win.

00:41:04.940 --> 00:41:06.550
What does it matter?

00:41:08.110 --> 00:41:11.910
Don't be afraid! Are those the words of
the man who controlled Kyokutou High?

00:41:12.690 --> 00:41:15.440
My arm's broken. There's nothing I can do.

00:41:16.940 --> 00:41:19.360
You're supposed to have broken it, right?

00:41:20.930 --> 00:41:24.050
Shut up! This has nothing to do with you!

00:41:24.250 --> 00:41:24.970
Go home!

00:41:25.830 --> 00:41:29.250
I see. Well, even if you don't go, I will.

00:41:30.370 --> 00:41:31.370
Do whatever you want.

00:41:31.970 --> 00:41:35.090
You've really hit rock bottom.

00:41:35.820 --> 00:41:40.130
The Onizuka at Kyokutou had the aura of
a top fighter and would never back down.

00:41:41.680 --> 00:41:43.810
Where's that amazing Onizuka I knew?!

00:41:56.570 --> 00:41:58.270
W-What's wrong with you?

00:41:58.370 --> 00:42:00.810
Show me where Machida is.

00:42:01.800 --> 00:42:02.560
What?

00:42:02.660 --> 00:42:04.660
I've come for a one-on-one fight!

00:42:07.990 --> 00:42:10.100
Olive Tree Pub

00:42:11.180 --> 00:42:12.850
No, let me go!

00:42:14.110 --> 00:42:17.620
So, Aina, wanna do it right here today?

00:42:17.740 --> 00:42:18.740
Let me go!

00:42:19.540 --> 00:42:20.700
Machida-san...

00:42:21.300 --> 00:42:23.470
What's with those faces?

00:42:24.370 --> 00:42:25.340
L-Look...

00:42:25.440 --> 00:42:26.810
Are you Machida?

00:42:28.060 --> 00:42:28.830
Ryuuji-kun!

00:42:29.490 --> 00:42:34.010
I'm Shonan's Danma Ryuuji, here
to finish what you started.

00:42:34.310 --> 00:42:36.220
Have you lost it?

00:42:36.520 --> 00:42:37.320
It's one-on-one.

00:42:39.220 --> 00:42:41.290
Don't run, you brass knuckled bastard!

00:42:41.990 --> 00:42:43.480
What?

00:42:43.520 --> 00:42:45.560
Let's do it then.

00:42:46.610 --> 00:42:47.900
Let's go outside.

00:42:48.090 --> 00:42:49.150
I intended to.

00:42:53.940 --> 00:42:54.640
Idiot!

00:42:54.820 --> 00:42:55.120
Huh?

00:42:55.420 --> 00:42:56.510
Ryuuji-kun!

00:43:16.760 --> 00:43:17.860
Ryuuji-kun!!

00:43:20.830 --> 00:43:24.260
T-That was low...

00:43:24.560 --> 00:43:28.300
It's too early for someone like you to take on me one-on-one...

00:43:28.400 --> 00:43:29.130
You worm!

00:43:35.220 --> 00:43:36.540
Hey, hey!

00:43:42.260 --> 00:43:45.100
You're going to kill him! Stop it!!

00:43:51.820 --> 00:43:53.290
Brats from Shonan are nothing.

00:43:54.710 --> 00:43:57.940
Hey guys, beat him up real good for me.

00:43:58.270 --> 00:43:59.110
O-Okay!

00:44:03.540 --> 00:44:05.250
Well, let's go, Aina.

00:44:05.350 --> 00:44:09.500
No, I've had enough! I want to leave!

00:44:10.700 --> 00:44:14.450
I'll kill you if you talk back to me, got it?

00:44:18.430 --> 00:44:19.660
Let's go!

00:44:22.460 --> 00:44:23.350
My Camaro...!

00:44:23.850 --> 00:44:25.570
Ah! You bastard!

00:44:27.080 --> 00:44:28.350
Let's start this...

00:44:29.650 --> 00:44:30.650
Eikichi-kun!

00:44:31.900 --> 00:44:34.000
From where we left off.

00:44:35.320 --> 00:44:36.150
What's wrong?!

00:44:38.410 --> 00:44:40.700
Too scared to say anything?

00:44:42.330 --> 00:44:46.040
So, you're not dead yet.
Have you come to lose again?

00:44:46.500 --> 00:44:50.560
Lose again? I've never lost.

00:44:50.860 --> 00:44:54.010
Remember this... the day I lose,

00:44:55.570 --> 00:44:57.030
is the day I die!

00:44:57.670 --> 00:44:59.110
Then die!

00:45:06.440 --> 00:45:07.110
What the hell?

00:45:07.790 --> 00:45:09.090
An eye for an eye...

00:45:10.560 --> 00:45:13.040
Brass knuckles for a steel plate.

00:45:13.670 --> 00:45:15.680
Y-You brat!

00:45:16.470 --> 00:45:21.920
Well then, how about we
have a nice one-on-one fight?

00:45:23.320 --> 00:45:24.240
You dumbass!

00:45:25.000 --> 00:45:28.000
You think you can defeat me in a one-on-one fight?

00:45:29.080 --> 00:45:33.150
You think you can beat me,
the high school boxing champ?

00:45:35.330 --> 00:45:37.510
Come on, say something.

00:45:38.570 --> 00:45:41.910
No matter how tough you sound,
your punches don't do anything.

00:45:42.550 --> 00:45:44.010
Boxer-kun!

00:45:44.560 --> 00:45:48.810
Then eat some more!

00:46:03.830 --> 00:46:04.660
Eikichi-kun!

00:46:05.200 --> 00:46:09.170
What's wrong, boxer? They aren't doing anything!

00:46:09.500 --> 00:46:11.200
You brat!!

00:46:18.590 --> 00:46:22.830
Game over already, you eyebrowless freak.

00:46:23.160 --> 00:46:27.770
As if I could lose to a kid like you!

00:46:34.730 --> 00:46:36.920
Kids these days are pretty scary...

00:46:39.330 --> 00:46:41.900
Because they have fighting spirit!

00:46:43.020 --> 00:46:46.330
Hey, all of you come beat this...

00:46:48.740 --> 00:46:52.770
Yo! Did you come to beat me up...?

00:46:53.040 --> 00:46:54.220
No-Brows-kun.

00:46:54.320 --> 00:46:55.910
N-No way!

00:46:56.010 --> 00:46:57.410
You're not getting away.

00:46:58.160 --> 00:47:02.070
The fight ain't over yet.

00:47:02.150 --> 00:47:04.950
<i>These guys... are gonna kill me!</i>

00:47:05.520 --> 00:47:09.360
We're getting payback!

00:47:19.610 --> 00:47:21.470
Everyone in Shonan...

00:47:21.970 --> 00:47:25.100
knows the names of Onizuka and Danma.

00:47:26.300 --> 00:47:29.370
If you're looking for a fight, come any time!

00:47:32.190 --> 00:47:33.400
Let's go, Eikichi.

00:47:33.600 --> 00:47:34.100
Yeah.

00:47:34.200 --> 00:47:35.400
Eikichi-kun!

00:47:38.190 --> 00:47:39.130
Thank you!

00:47:39.630 --> 00:47:42.870
You... you came for me...

00:47:43.400 --> 00:47:48.340
so I decided I'm going to be your girl.

00:47:54.620 --> 00:47:57.810
Silly! Don't get the wrong idea.

00:47:58.150 --> 00:48:00.650
I came here for myself.

00:48:02.000 --> 00:48:04.110
It's past your bedtime kid, so go home.

00:48:04.780 --> 00:48:05.510
Later!

00:48:08.810 --> 00:48:09.940
Hey, Ryuuji...

00:48:10.040 --> 00:48:10.780
Yeah?

